# Root build context (services/arcade/Dockerfile): an allowlist, so nothing else (operator data with its wallet seeds,
# environment files, research notes) can ever enter an image. The operator builds from services/operator, not here.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/*/package.json
!services/*/package.json
!packages/
!services/arcade/
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
